  "title": "Not on the Phone",
  "summary": "The phone was online for six minutes at lunchtime at a high school. Scrolling back through her own thread, Tess finds the visit June asked for on 11 January, \"not on the phone\", and her own reply postponing it. Margo, June's next-door neighbour, says June was out of sorts that week and that a truck was in the lane on the 12th.",
  "status": "final",
  "cliffhanger": "Margo: \"it was Owen's truck. The green one.\"",
