        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m01",
          "sender": "tess",
          "text": "I scrolled up. \"It will keep.\" She asked me to come on the 16th and I said I was busy."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m02",
          "sender": "kofi",
          "text": "You WERE busy"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m03",
          "sender": "tess",
          "text": "After Mum and Dad, she drove up every Sunday for a year. She never once asked me to come to her for a reason."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m04",
          "sender": "kofi",
          "text": "Tess. You didn't know"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m05",
          "sender": "tess",
          "text": "I write down what people say for a living. I should have heard that one."
        }
      ],
      "meta": {
        "beat": "Guilt."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "type": "conversation",
      "theme": "light",
      "exportProfile": "iphone",
      "presentation": {
        "statusBar": {
          "time": "10:31"
        }
      },
      "deviceOwner": "tess",
      "participants": [
        "tess",
        "margo"
      ],
      "messages": [
        {
          "kind": "timestamp",
          "id": "t01",
          "label": "Fri, Feb 5 at 10:15 AM"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m01",
          "sender": "margo",
          "text": "Now Tess, I hope you don't mind me texting, Glen gave me your number and said you were asking about things."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m02",
          "sender": "margo",
          "text": "June was out of sorts that week. She came over for tea on the Monday after her shift at Harbour Drug and she barely touched her shortbread, which as you know is not like her."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m03",
          "sender": "margo",
          "text": "She said \"Margo, sometimes you find out a person you like isn't who you thought.\" I assumed it was Glen and the TV remote. She wouldn't say."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m04",
          "sender": "tess",
          "text": "Thank you, Margo. That helps. Did you see anyone at the house on Tuesday the 12th?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m05",
          "sender": "margo",
          "text": "The delivery boy from the pharmacy about suppertime, he always parks across my lane. And earlier there was a truck in the lane. Early afternoon."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m06",
          "sender": "tess",
          "text": "What kind of truck?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m07",
          "sender": "margo",
          "text": "I'd rather not say on a text, dear. You know how this town is."
        }
      ],
      "meta": {
        "beat": "Margo: a truck in the lane."
      }
    },
    {
